      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i thought so. it's just such a weird feeling, like it's heavy but not really painful. i've been really stressed with work lately so it's probably just my jaw clenching while i sleep or something. do you think i should just take some more ibuprofen or maybe a muscle relaxant to sleep it off? i'd rather just handle it at home if i can.",
