      "content": "yeah i'll try the stretching. i just feel like going to a doctor over some jaw tension is overkill and a waste of time. if i take like 800mg of ibuprofen every few hours for a day or two, that should definitely clear up any inflammation or muscle stuff, right? i really just want to get through the work week without having to deal with a clinic visit.",
